{"product_id":"keira-the-film-star-fairy","title":"Keira the Film Star Fairy","description":"\u003cp\u003eA real hollywood blockbuster is filming in kirsty's village, and the girls have parts as extras! everything goes like a dream, until jack frost's goblins steal keira the film star fairy's three magical items. Unless kirsty and rachel can get the silver script, the magical megaphone and the enchanted clapperboard back, work on a movie set will never go right again.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 151 x 196\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Daisy Meadows\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781408315972\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 173\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45602593702041,"sku":"16RC-4-9781408315972","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68848e10782b1_Keira_the_Film_Star_Fairy_Daisy_Meadows.jpg?v=1753711316","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/keira-the-film-star-fairy","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}